WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.7 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
RACI and process ownership

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
RACI shows who does, who owns, who advises and who is told.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Keep exactly one Accountable per row.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Consult as few people as possible.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Fix rows with no owner or two owners.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio, trainee selection: Diego responsible and accountable; Lucía and the municipality consulted; advisory group informed.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create a RACI for five key processes.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
